{"parse":{"title":"The Burden of Creative Genius","pageid":395725,"revid":2149788,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Burden of Creative Genius</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/ff/Constellation_The_Burden_of_Creative_Genius.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024427\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation The Burden of Creative Genius\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/ff/Constellation_The_Burden_of_Creative_Genius.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024427\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/ff/Constellation_The_Burden_of_Creative_Genius.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024427 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/ff/Constellation_The_Burden_of_Creative_Genius.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024427 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation The Burden of Creative Genius\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_The_Burden_of_Creative_Genius.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation The Burden of Creative Genius.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Turbine_of_Metal_and_Light\" title=\"Perpetual Turbine of Metal and Light\">Perpetual Turbine of Metal and Light</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">For the next 15s after using the Elemental Burst <a href=\"/wiki/Precision_Hydronic_Cooler\" title=\"Precision Hydronic Cooler\">Precision Hydronic Cooler</a>, DMG from nearby active characters' <a href=\"/wiki/Electro-Charged\" title=\"Electro-Charged\">Electro-Charged</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bloom\" title=\"Bloom\">Bloom</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged\" title=\"Lunar-Charged\">Lunar-Charged</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom\">Lunar-Bloom</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize\">Lunar-Crystallize</a> reactions is increased by 15%.<br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b>: DMG from the aforementioned reactions will be further increased by 20%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electro-Charged_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Electro-Charged DMG Bonus\">Electro-Charged DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloom_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bloom DMG Bonus\">Bloom DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Charged DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Charged DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize DMG Bonus\">Lunar-Crystallize DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsign:_Ascendant_Gleam\" title=\"Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam\">Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Burden of Creative Genius</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-e